les like his ancestors are watching. An alchemist panics at round numbers. Read the customer's mind and choose your approach. Improve your trade skills along the way. But more importantly, learn the ancient merchant art of knowing exactly when to shut up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416430/extras/8a49dafc4cca5bc15d850bfeec5a78ca.poster.avif?t=1784625520\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416430/extras/8a49dafc4cca5bc15d850bfeec5a78ca.webm?t=1784625520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416430/extras/8a49dafc4cca5bc15d850bfeec5a78ca.mp4?t=1784625520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416430/extras/06682aad7b3b5d590b9add6a8a2536ab.webp?t=1784625520\" width=705 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world magic dictates the value, not metal. Hundreds of items pass through your shop. Not all of them are honest about what they are. Some carry enchantments worth a small fortune. Some are wrapped in illusions that make a rusty dagger look like a legendary blade. And some are cursed badly enough to turn the next owner into a chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416430/extras/00d489c22e7f1d4662c5497dd678b393.poster.avif?t=1784625520\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st